      309.31,
      455.87,
      337.58
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of 2009(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section asamended is\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.87,
      347.59,
      449.88,
      375.74
    ],
    "text": "(a) to determine the base of calculation of the payment of tax, in respect of thesupply of financial services and to remove the exemption granted on supplyof financial services; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.87,
      385.63,
      412.44,
      394.7
    ],
    "text": "(b) to exempt certain articles from the liability of the payment of tax.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      404.83,
      455.88,
      432.98
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends the First Schedule to the principal enactment and thelegal effect of the said Schedule as amended is to extend the scope of exemption to morearticles.",
